sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser
    participant GUI as Viser GUI Timeline
    participant Clock as Animation Clock Thread (~30 Hz)
    participant Playback as PlaybackController
    participant Viewer as ViserMotionViewer
    participant Scene as Viser Scene Handles

    Note over Clock,Playback: Continuous Playback Loop (Decoupled from Inference)
    loop Every ~33ms (target_dt = 1/30s)
        Clock->>Playback: update(dt * speed)
        alt is_playing == true
            Playback->>Playback: Advance current_time += dt * speed
            alt current_time >= duration && loop == true
                Playback->>Playback: Wrap current_time % duration (No re-inference!)
            else current_time >= duration && loop == false
                Playback->>Playback: Clamp to duration, is_playing = false
            end
            Playback-->>Clock: Return (current_frame, changed_flag)
            alt changed_flag == true
                Clock->>Viewer: _render_current_frame()
                Viewer->>Scene: joint_handle.points = joints[frame]
                Viewer->>Scene: bone_handle.points = bone_segments[frame]
                Viewer->>GUI: Update timeline slider value
            end
        end
    end

    opt User Interacts with Controls
        User->>GUI: Drag Timeline Slider to Frame K
        GUI->>Playback: seek_frame(K)
        Playback->>Playback: Set current_time = K / fps
        Playback-->>Viewer: _render_current_frame()
        Viewer->>Scene: Update joint & bone positions at Frame K
    end
